  "goodToKnow": "Illustrieren means to illustrate, with pictures (ein Kinderbuch illustrieren) or examples (einen Punkt illustrieren). The native German synonym is veranschaulichen. Die Illustration is an illustration, der Illustrator an illustrator, and die Illustrierte a glossy magazine such as Stern or Bunte. Perfect without ge-: hat illustriert."
